# TC-SRCH-001 – Verify Recipe Search Returns Exact Match When Queried by Recipe ID

- **Severity:** Medium
- **Environment:** Production · macOS Sonoma 14.4 · MacBook Air (Apple M1) · Safari 17.4 (anonymized)
- **Reproducibility:** 100%

## Summary
Verify that entering a valid recipe ID into the website search bar ("ძებნა") returns the corresponding recipe in the search results instead of a "not found / does not exist" message.

## Steps
1. Open the recipe website and locate any recipe along with its valid ID.
2. Click on the search bar ("ძებნა") and enter the recipe ID.
3. Submit the search query and observe the displayed search results.

## Actual
Searching by a valid recipe ID fails to return the recipe and displays a message stating that no such product/item exists.

## Expected
Searching by a valid recipe ID should return the matching recipe in the search results.

## Notes
Functional Correctness / Search & Indexing Logic. Verify whether recipe IDs are indexed and supported in the search query.
